{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54798","headline":"兵要望江南 占北斗第十四（京本作「占斗第四」○十六首） 十四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占北斗第十四（京本作「占斗第四」○十六首） 十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黑云气，夜散（辛本、川本作「蔽」）星斗中。\n如此三朝当有雨，急须准备候天情（辛本作「晴」），此理甚分明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54798.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54798","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}